 "notes": "Same series as animation2: same Trigger-like cyberpunk style, the lead red_marked_boy (card 8), blond_boy (card 0), old_cyborg (card 4) and Thai Netflix dubbing credits at the end. Show still not recognised by name. NEW characters: cracked_face_woman = dark-skinned woman with black crack markings on her forehead, purple eyeshadow, teal lips, long black hair (card 2); goggled_green_haired_girl = dark-skinned girl with pale green hair, purple goggles/headband, freckles (card 5); capped_man = grim man in a cap with goggles, seen in profile in dark light (card 7, 15:16-17:08); jaw_device_man = black-haired heavy-set man with a metal jaw/cheek brace and orange mouthpiece (card 9); glasses_kid = small boy with shaved striped scalp, big glasses, red eyes, fangs, green shirt (card 10); pale_blond_man = pale worried young man with slicked olive-blond hair, dark-ringed eyes, purple collar (U17/18/20/24/25, 5:22-5:52); worried_tufted_man = grey-toned worried man with tufted hair (C1T6/T8, C6T1, 5:37-5:42). Uncertain: (1) card 3 (pale cyborg-like man, pink/red crest hair, red-lit visor goggles; C3T0 vivid red hair, red eyes) labelled red_haired_masked_cyborg as the same character unmasked; if wrong, rename to a new label (pink_crested_visor_man); teal_haired_cyborg is the other candidate (red-lit visor). U39-U44 follow card 3. (2) U1 (0:47, stubbled scarred man with crack line on forehead, cigarette) labelled smoking_man. Card 2 is a different person (a woman), not smoking_man. (3) card 9: C9T1 (19:41, 14 faces, green-lit upturned heavy face) is the larger track; taken as jaw_device_man (similar build, a mouthpiece-like blob under the chin) but not certain; if not, card 9 majority would be unknown. (4) cards 1 and 6 are junk: card 1 is mostly a wall of tiny ID-photo faces at 10:18 (all different people, unknown) plus misc; card 6 is mostly washed-out pink end-credits art (24:25-25:47, unknown). (5) U16/U19/U21 (5:22-5:33, plated face with round mechanical eyes) labelled old_cyborg. U30 (brown spiky hair, green eyes, no markings) and dark U31/U32 labelled red_marked_boy on look/context. U55/U57 (dark, rain) and U61 (spiral eyes) and U72/U73 (chibi crying green-haired child) labelled goggled_green_haired_girl, less certain. U53 (16:07, grey goggled man beside the old cyborg) labelled capped_man. U76/U77 (20:28, pink-red hair with dark lower-face mask) left unknown: could be pink_haired_girl or red_haired_masked_cyborg. U52/U60/U78 fiery grinning faces, U82-U90 red/orange-lit men left unknown. C5T6 (17:32 yellow screaming face) unknown. Checked: 303.011 glasses kid lying upside down, face visible, unboxed; 454.579 red_marked_boy large close-up, unboxed; 151.526 a figure seen from behind (not counted); 1515.514 tiny credits-art figure ignored. Renamed when matching names across the series (same face, different names): goggled_green_haired_girl -> freckled_goggles_girl.",
